  "description": "The S&P 500 is nearing a breakout, and 3 AI stocks are showing impressive strength. Here's a quick breakdown...",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Monday! We had a good ending to the stock market last week. This has been the norm… a somewhat choppy Monday and Tuesday… and then a rally towards the end of the week. I mentioned last week that either the market is setting up for a huge upside move, or a huge fake out. The S&amp;P 500 has been consolidating since ~ 13 August, forming higher lows and higher highs locally. With price action continuing to compress, I find it likely that we will have the big move soon… probably in a few days or next week. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N1xN!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6315b1e4-a17f-42c9-a52b-c3af44716a29_960x822.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N1xN!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6315b1e4-a17f-42c9-a52b-c3af44716a29_960x822.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N1xN!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6315b1e4-a17f-42c9-a52b-c3af44716a29_960x822.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N1xN!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6315b1e4-a17f-42c9-a52b-c3af44716a29_960x822.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N1xN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6315b1e4-a17f-42c9-a52b-c3af44716a29_960x822.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N1xN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6315b1e4-a17f-42c9-a52b-c3af44716a29_960x822.png\" width=\"960\" height=\"822\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6315b1e4-a17f-42c9-a52b-c3af44716a29_960x822.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:822,&quot;width&quot;:960,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:527703,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/220040474?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6315b1e4-a17f-42c9-a52b-c3af44716a29_960x822.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N1xN!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6315b1e4-a17f-42c9-a52b-c3af44716a29_960x822.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N1xN!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6315b1e4-a17f-42c9-a52b-c3af44716a29_960x822.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N1xN!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6315b1e4-a17f-42c9-a52b-c3af44716a29_960x822.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N1xN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6315b1e4-a17f-42c9-a52b-c3af44716a29_960x822.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">S&amp;P 500 constructing a bullish chart structure. Typically, the longer the consolidation, the bigger the move is. We have not seen any individual stocks truly crash, so I am optimistic the move will be to the upside. Though never guaranteed!</figcaption></figure></div><p>If you are new to my page, it is normal that I target influencers who spout ridiculous, uneducated content out, or are blatantly lying. However, when I came across rainy.talks on TikTok, I was pleasantly surprised. In his <strong><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/t/ZTyGbaE7m/\">original video</a>, he seems to be more of a narrative investor, but in short he says:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Amphenol, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$AMPH&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>: Makes high speed cables and connectors for AI, that traditional cables cannot keep up with. </p></li><li><p>nVent, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$NVT&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>: Liquid cooling to keep up with AI</p></li><li><p>Eaton, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$ETN&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>: Makes the power between the grid and the servers. AI cannot go down for even a moment. </p></li></ul><p><strong>Full disclosure: </strong> I do not know rainy.talks personally, had never seen his content until today. I have no judgement or association with the rest of his content or performance. I am reviewing his 1 video by itself. I also give no predictions for 5 years into the future, as stated in his video. </p><p>I look for stocks that have a high probability of running, <em><strong>NOW</strong></em>. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>But in reviewing these 3 stocks, he picked some winners in my opinion. Each of them:</p><ul><li><p>Has well developed uptrends. Do not fight trends!</p></li><li><p>Has formed higher highs and higher lows locally, a great signal for continuation. </p></li><li><p>Each stock has improved EPS and revenue annually. </p></li><li><p>I also love that these stocks do NOT have bloated market caps, a dilemma that Nvidia, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$NVDA&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> faces.  </p></li></ul><p>Overall, I cannot find anything to really ding these stocks. In fact, nVent came in 2nd place in last week’s midweek movers. You can <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/i-ranked-27-stocks-these-3-came-out\">Watch that episode here.</a></strong></p><p>The market just seems to be hanging out today. Nothing is crashing. Mostly just some more sideways chop, which is perfectly fine. </p><p>As always, if you have questions, stop by the main chat during market hours, where I am available. </p><h4>Be sure to like ❤️ and RE-STACK 🔄 if you like this content!</h4><p>Thanks for stopping by! </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W3S9!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8add7fc9-8edc-4748-ba33-360428e75ee1_1206x1206.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
